        "Project Overview\n",
        "This repository showcases a multi-headed LSTM and Transformer pipeline for Ethereum token transfer forecasting and panel forecasting across BTCUSDT, ETHUSDT, and SOLUSDT. The models were trained on real-world token transfer data and evaluated using both point forecast metrics and quantile-based loss functions.\n",
