        "Validation Metrics\n",
        "Single-Series Models (Evaluated on 2025 Validation Data)\n",
        "- Seasonal Naive: MAE = 508,919.05, RMSE = 627,417.51, sMAPE = 32.13%\n",
        "- Weekly Naive: MAE = 245,855.83, RMSE = 392,365.80, sMAPE = 13.21%\n",
        "- LSTM: MAE = 444,396.26, RMSE = 599,132.21, sMAPE = 26.44%\n",
        "- Transformer: MAE = 260,753.99, RMSE = 398,448.59, sMAPE = 14.21%\n",
        "Metrics were computed from point forecasts, either directly or via median/mean aggregation depending on training objective.\n",
