        "- Panel Transformer (ETHUSDT): Pinball Loss = 0.005969\n",
        "- Panel Transformer (SOLUSDT): Pinball Loss = 0.007407\n",
        "Panel models were trained to output quantiles and evaluated on log-transformed realized variance.\n",
